# Claude API key — used for summarization, Bengali translation, and categorization.
# Required. Without this, RSS items can be fetched but no articles can be generated.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""

# Public site URL, used for metadata, sitemap, and RSS feed generation.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# Optional shared secret required by the /api/debug/news diagnostics route.
# If unset, that route is open (no auth check).
CRON_SECRET=""

# No DATABASE_URL: this project has no database. See lib/data.ts — every
# page is served from an in-memory RSS -> AI -> Next.js cache pipeline
# that refreshes itself automatically every 10 minutes.
